(# PenuX at Hadassah Ein Kerem ICU ? 1-Page Collaboration Brief) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Objective) Tj
T*
(Validate PenuX \(early prediction of sepsis and AKI in ICU patients\) on an Israeli real-world cohort at Hadas) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Why Hadassah ICU) Tj
T*
(? Strong critical-care clinical infrastructure.) Tj
T*
(? Diverse internal-medicine and ICU case mix.) Tj
T*
(? High translational-research potential from retrospective validation to prospective workflow testing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Project Snapshot) Tj
T*
(? Model scope: ICU deterioration risk \(sepsis + AKI\).) Tj
T*
(? Data foundation: MIMIC-III/IV time-series variables.) Tj
T*
(? Architecture: Bi-LSTM for sequential clinical data.) Tj
T*
(? Development approach: IEC 62304-oriented lifecycle documentation and traceability.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Proposed Validation Plan \(Phase 1\)) Tj
T*
(1. Retrospective cohort definition \(adult ICU admissions, inclusion/exclusion criteria, target labels\).) Tj
T*
(2. Data harmonization between local variables and model inputs.) Tj
T*
(3. External validation \(AUROC/AUPRC, calibration, subgroup analysis\).) Tj
T*
(4. Clinical utility assessment \(lead time, alert burden, workflow fit\).) Tj
T*
(5. Feasibility report for prospective silent-mode pilot.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(What We Need from Site Collaboration) Tj
T*
(? Clinical PI and ICU data-science counterpart.) Tj
T*
(? Access pathway for de-identified retrospective ICU data \(per IRB/privacy rules\).) Tj
T*
(? Periodic clinical review meetings for outcome interpretation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Potential Outputs) Tj
T*
(? Joint abstract/manuscript.) Tj
T*
(? Grant-ready preliminary results.) Tj
T*
(? Decision framework for prospective deployment pilot.) Tj
